    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Tender Tiger → Postgres → Microsoft Teams\n**One-time:** run `bash tt_setup.sh` on your PC (it prints the helper URL/token).\n**Config:** fill service URL, token, Tender Tiger email + password.\n**Teams:** create a Teams Workflows incoming webhook for the target channel, then paste its URL into `Send summary to Microsoft Teams`.\nRuns at 9am, 1pm, 6pm and 9pm IST once you activate/publish the workflow. Sends a run summary even when no new tenders are found.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 560
      },
